ID;PXL;N;EP;PGeneralP;P0P;P0.00P;P#,##0P;P#,##0.00P;P$#,##0 ;;($#,##0)P;P$#,##0.00 ;;($#,##0.00)P;P0%P;P0.00%P;P0.00E+00P;Pm/d/yyP;Pd-mmm-yyP;Pd-mmmP;Pmmm-yyP;Ph:mm AM/PMP;Ph:mm:ss AM/PMP;Ph:mmP;Ph:mm:ssP;Pm/d/yy h:mmF;P0;DG0G10;E;G;N3 10B;Y62;X2O;L;EF;W1 1 8F;W2 2 22NN;NAUTOMATIC;Ga;ER59C2NN;NBOLD;GB;ER39C1NN;NDOLLAR.FORMAT;Gd;ER56C1NN;NERRORS;GE;ER51C2NN;NFORMAT.NUMBER;GN;ER52C1NN;NITALIC;GI;ER43C1NN;NLEFT.NAMES;GL;ER25C1NN;NMANUAL;Gm;ER55C2NN;NPAGE.DOWN;Gj;ER25C2NN;NPAGE.LEFT;Gh;ER37C2NN;NPAGE.RIGHT;Gl;ER33C2NN;NPAGE.UP;Gk;ER29C2NN;NPASTE.SPECIAL;Gp;ER41C2NN;NPLAIN.OVERLAY;GO;ER47C1NN;NRUN;Gr;ER31C1NN;NRUN.SELECTION;GR;ER35C1NN;NVALUES;Gv;ER45C2F;SD;Y1C;K"This macro sheet contains very simple command"F;SD;Y2C;K"macros for common tasks and actions.  The"F;SD;Y3C;K"Option-Command keys assigned to the macros"F;SD;Y4C;K"allow you to run them from the keyboard."F;SD;Y5;X1C;K"INDEX"F;SD;X2F;SDTLBR;Y6;X1C;K"Name [key]"F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"Description"F;STLR;Y7;X1C;K"BOLD [B]"F;STLR;X2C;K"Set selection to Bold style."F;SLR;Y8;X1C;K"ITALIC [I]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Set selection to Italic style."F;SLR;Y9;X1C;K"PLAIN.OVERLAY [O]"F;SLR;X2C;K"If worksheet, set selection to plain style;; if chart, display Overlay Chart Type dialog box."F;SLR;Y10;X1C;K"FORMAT.NUMBER [N]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Display the Number dialog box."F;SLR;Y11;X1C;K"DOLLAR.FORMAT [d]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Set selection to dollar format."F;SLR;Y12;X1C;K"PAGE.DOWN [j]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Scroll down one page."F;SLR;Y13;X1C;K"PAGE.LEFT [h]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Scroll left one page."F;SLR;Y14;X1C;K"PAGE.RIGHT [l]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Scroll right one page."F;SLR;Y15;X1C;K"PAGE.UP [k]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Scroll up one page."F;SLR;Y16;X1C;K"PASTE.SPECIAL [p]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Display the Paste Special dialog box."F;SLR;Y17;X1C;K"VALUES [v]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Convert formulas to values."F;SLR;Y18;X1C;K"AUTOMATIC  [a]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Set calculation to automatic."F;SLR;Y19;X1C;K"MANUAL  [m]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Set calculation to manual."F;SLR;Y20;X1C;K"ERRORS [E]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Find error values."F;SLR;Y21;X1C;K"LEFT.NAMES [L]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Create row names from left column, replacing any existing names."F;SLR;Y22;X1C;K"RUN [r]"F;SLR;X2C;K"Display the Run dialog box."F;SLBR;Y23;X1C;K"RUN.SELECTION [R]"F;SLBR;X2C;K"Run the macro starting at the active cell."F;SDTLBR;Y25;X1C;K"LEFT.NAMES [L]"F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"PAGE.DOWN [j]"F;STLR;Y26;X1C;K"Create row names from left column, replacing any existing names.  The ERROR(FALSE) prevents the alert box from appearing for existing names."F;STLR;X2C;K"Scroll down one page."F;SLR;Y27;X1C;KTRUE;EERROR(FALSE)F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;EVPAGE(1)F;SLR;Y28;X1C;KTRUE;ECREATE.NAMES(FALSE,TRUE)F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLR;Y29;X1C;KTRUE;EERROR(TRUE)F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"PAGE.UP [k]"F;SLBR;Y30;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;STLR;X2C;K"Scroll up one page."F;SDTLBR;Y31;X1C;K"RUN [r]"F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;EVPAGE(-1)F;STLR;Y32;X1C;K"Display the Run dialog box."F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLR;Y33;X1C;KFALSE;ERUN?()F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"PAGE.RIGHT [l]"F;SLBR;Y34;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;STLR;X2C;K"Scroll right one page."F;SDTLBR;Y35;X1C;K"RUN.SELECTION [R]"F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;EHPAGE(1)F;STLR;Y36;X1C;K"Run the macro starting at the active cell.  This is particularly useful when you are writing and testing macros."F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLR;Y37;X1C;K#N/A;ERUN(ACTIVE.CELL())F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"PAGE.LEFT [h]"F;SLBR;Y38;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;STLR;X2C;K"Scroll left one page."F;SDTLBR;Y39;X1C;K"BOLD [B]"F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;EHPAGE(-1)F;STLR;Y40;X1C;K"Set selection to Bold style.  Note that the second argument to STYLE is omitted rather than FALSE, so that the macro won't change the Italic-status."F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLR;Y41;X1C;KTRUE;ESTYLE(TRUE,)F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"PASTE.SPECIAL [p]"F;SLBR;Y42;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;STLR;X2C;K"Display the Paste Special dialog box."F;SDTLBR;Y43;X1C;K"ITALIC [I]"F;SLR;X2C;KFALSE;EPASTE.SPECIAL?()F;STLR;Y44;X1C;K"Set selection to Italic style.  Note that the first argument to STYLE is omitted rather than FALSE, so that the macro won't change the Bold-status."F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLR;Y45;X1C;KTRUE;ESTYLE(,TRUE)F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"VALUES [v]"F;SLBR;Y46;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;STLR;X2C;K"Convert formulas to values."F;SDTLBR;Y47;X1C;K"PLAIN.OVERLAY [O]"F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;ECOPY()F;STLR;Y48;X1C;K"If worksheet, set selection to plain style;; if chart, display Overlay Chart Type dialog box.  The ISERROR(MAIN.CHART.TYPE) determines whether the active document is a worksheet or chart."F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;EPASTE.SPECIAL(3,1)F;SLR;Y49;X1C;KTRUE;EERROR(FALSE)F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;ECANCEL.COPY()F;SLR;Y50;X1C;KTRUE;EIF(ISERROR(MAIN.CHART.TYPE()),STYLE(FALSE,FALSE),OVERLAY.CHART.TYPE?())F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLBR;Y51;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"ERRORS [E]"F;SDTLR;Y52;X1C;K"FORMAT.NUMBER [N]"F;STLR;X2C;K"Find error values."F;STLR;Y53;X1C;K"Display the Number dialog box."F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;EFORMULA.FIND("#",2,2,1)F;SLR;Y54;X1C;KFALSE;EFORMAT.NUMBER?()F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLBR;Y55;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"MANUAL [m]"F;SDTLBR;Y56;X1C;K"DOLLAR.FORMAT [d]"F;STLR;X2C;K"Sets calculation to manual."F;STLR;Y57;X1C;K"Set selection to dollar format."F;SLR;X2C;KTRUE;ECALCULATION(3,,,)F;SLR;Y58;X1C;KTRUE;EFORMAT.NUMBER("$#,##0.00 ;;($#,##0.00)")F;SLBR;X2C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SLBR;Y59;X1C;KTRUE;ERETURN()F;SDTLBR;X2C;K"AUTOMATIC [a]"F;STLR;Y60C;K"Sets calculation to automatic."F;SLR;Y61C;KTRUE;ECALCULATION(1,,,)F;SLBR;Y62C;KTRUE;ERETURN()E